mpleted breakover operations for the Neutron Stage 2 tank assembly, rotating the stage horizontal – a critical step in the handling of large rocket sections for integration and assembly. Here’s a last look at Stage 2 on the Neutron Factory floor before it’s wrapped up (literally) for barge shipment to LC-3 on Wallops Island where its fluid systems will be tested and its Archimedes vacuum engine installed.","image":"","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/6dce370ed3.mp4?token=UvxiqQ0jtBfPn7xgP093EuMlwIpfVsiceHs_PwcKfyj5qmTfKFIYfhd0L5NaE0IqCNaQwAM9YXIi05Db1fPWDkvtik9FgRRyYermkhiSC8JnTFMgViomVDu2T93vUrsP8TXdj33nqZDggXcZI97cJ2YZUxvb2SpTyDxkJuR5TMMHBqImU87PHiLzZMJqkSxYtf-OH4jzMT7PoRT4VvinOaZXRGedG1ZiC6zMK814eXhvvwD-jAj8jUXl6I6UvW-6_tzn-fTh727DkQtq7b0r0oOir3kNtFIAPNnCBgq6Hyg3OC-ZrZEVoz0EPqjcR_zZwIz1W1fddx3zXekQX8GOi7-wML1WOZfmFFWlHpEx19f4nAoE406zFEbMr0WDhpZY-DABGCk6rIIgqAY9sqLB67qYHH2ZrIcWyfvQRrWB26r3QYhFWFp8fqs4GTrxCCDZb-opi6gW5z9U_tP6LoZBYc3HJa1mBVtgDB7e6uKUGiZczhZHfZvzNX6lRZu-VXXPA0_HtXsNyueErtxuHbTKVeegHJAY3FKS1G1jMXbSsN1X5llxz3lcFUC5Quhzzuwal_jkZITmUYY93WQ7ekHmHhMKDq-Tbp2ZhZc8e9QI0TO1WN3lUHufxIsbjJsD7vj1dldXggXYx7n2JjtTK_XyB1peHeFpBPz3WWacxtZ7ocM","hasVideo":true},{"id":"412","date":"2026-10-21T16:20:12+00:00","text":"The Maxwell spacecraft is in orbit and ready to get to work. The spacecraft we built for viasat launched from Cape Canaveral yesterday. Over the next five months, it will demonstrate how Viasat's ViaSat-3 Ka-band and global L-band networks can give low Earth orbit missions near real-time data and telemetry, tracking and command (TT&C) at any point in orbit, supporting NASA's Communications Services Project as it prepares to retire its TDRS fleet. Congratulations to the Viasat team on a successful launch&#33;","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Cur3NJHCujOoU14s9_3hgeQB4MWITKNIc_EKWbS8zfe-cEh-cfGJN-W-vaDQTPMPhG1kBlokJnhAHc-l8C3xYwJKuIqbWwjJTi0DSg6Ye-cz6f5GCQeh7TCzLd7PyxJPsHCfV5LfocYfrsLR-WecWn_z2irAgZGbXgKAYMKCdxIbNNbjyMnk8WtfgcvzToCed9AZ9Et01HGcmtixeu