[{"id":"432","date":"2026-10-27T20:41:58+00:00","text":"Members of SemperCitiusSDA's Tranche 2 leadership team were recently at Rocket Lab's California headquarters to see T2TL-Beta in production. Eight of 18 spacecraft are on the floor right now, in build. Solar panels, structures, star trackers, reaction wheels, radios, flight software, avionics, launch dispenser — all built in-house. Proliferated architectures demand production at scale. Rocket Lab is all in on SDA's mission, and the action on our floor proves it. We're proud to be delivering this.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/RvFutDp_zUuqYtuC0RuX2Xg0Gt5lQHkOBzp_x6Ft7U3CrDtC0MEq7S2ro4XM-nVE6eaqFKqk3Wzv6hK8i21HGjf1MwcL49t4hal4E__aJzUTD69HZik4JYRRlmkTErOwFi0K-J7Bd8PJm1tj5nggEKOd6Na2Ww0XIJjbWOm6_glGVaqb80XKB0RSuj5AyXGuD7SXmFBA_Y_mJHAt00Vemr-FeW9idBbP8pghvnnkUvMjIiHxQ8-7WJ20d32TSXMLtJaXtX07wM98xpV8coi0RkXJCUtUOkrtPvtK5u1GNtvM8djl5Xm93dZ9mbjVBQmvhcI1TTAW3kwHjNpxmXJu8g.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"431","date":"2026-10-27T02:45:07+00:00","text":"Every 8 days an Electron rocket rolls off the production line thanks to our mission-obsessed team and advanced factories. The Electron team is growing as we prepare to launch more rockets than ever before in 2027. Role open across vehicle assembly, composites, GNC, propulsion, manufacturing engineering, software, and more. Those with automotive, aerospace, marine, aviation, and manufacturing experience are a great fit. Come to New Zealand and Long Beach, CA to design, build, test, and launch rockets. Relocation support available. Adventure awaits: https://t.co/F3ZNC0C0B2","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"427","date":"2026-10-27T01:16:35+00:00","text":"It’s a beautiful day to set sail with the next pieces of Neutron flight hardware to Launch Complex 3. Earlier today we sent Neutron’s Stage 2 and Thrust Module out of the Neutron Factory and onto a barge for transport through Chesapeake Bay to Wallops Island in Virginia. Once it arrives, the Thru